{"id": "q_longmont_session_12_council_chamber_roster", "question": "Who's actually in the council chamber for the Session 12 fight with the Wolf?", "answer": "TL;DR: The fight in the council chamber includes the Players, the Wolf, Thalia, and multiple Guards (including reinforcements); council members themselves are not explicitly confirmed present during the combat.\n\nBased on OBSERVED facts:\n- Players are actively involved in the confrontation and “the players recount their story to the council,” then engage in events that escalate into combat.\n- the Wolf is explicitly “adversary… in the council chamber battle” and has a listed current_location including “Council Room.”\n- Thalia is present with “Wolf is standing at Thalia’s shoulder” and she “attacks the group after the Wolf's instruction.”\n- Guards are present and escalating: “guards are being drawn here as reinforcements,” with multiple guards (including elite) engaging in combat actions.\n\nNo explicit fact confirms council members remain in the room once the fight breaks out—only that the players were interacting with them beforehand.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Participants: Players (6 PCs), the Wolf (primary enemy), Thalia (ensorcelled commander), Guards (8 regular + 2 elite noted)\n- Reinforcements: Guards actively entering the chamber\n- Environment: Council Chambers with active magical defenses and hazards (illusory walls, runes)", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 732, "post_filter_count": 30, "duration_ms": 25, "top_5": [["ent_the_wolf", 2.0561], ["ent_branching_paths_after_the_fight", 1.8017], ["ent_city_council", 1.6405], ["ent_battle_with_the_wolf_in_the_council_chamber", 1.6], ["ent_arcane_locks", 1.5269]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_the_wolf", "ent_branching_paths_after_the_fight", "ent_city_council", "ent_battle_with_the_wolf_in_the_council_chamber", "ent_arcane_locks", "ent_magic_pulse_alarms", "ent_magical_alarm_system", "ent_escape_tunnel", "en