{"id": "q_longmont_campaign_general_notes_1", "question": "Who are the Shepherds, and what god or power do they answer to?", "answer": "TL;DR: The Shepherds (the Shepherd’s Flock) are a cult actively recruiting and agitating in the city, and they answer to **Maelthor**, whose influence they believe they are advancing.\n\nThe **Shepherd’s Flock** is a cult group operating publicly (through protests) and covertly (through recruitment and manipulation). They target “profoundly affected individuals,” especially transformed people, and bring them into their ranks by revealing a “truth” about their condition. Internally, they justify extreme actions as necessary sacrifices.\n\nThey explicitly serve **Maelthor**:\n- OBSERVED: They are “followers of Maelthor.”\n- OBSERVED: They are aligned with “Maelthor’s influence and emergence.”\n\nTheir ideology centers on purification and dominance:\n- CANON: They believe their actions “cleanse the world of impurities resisting Maelthor’s influence.”\n- CANON: They aim at “ensuring human supremacy.”\n\nPublicly, they mask their actions as defensive necessity, framing incidents as protection against non-human threats.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Role: Cultists staging protests and recruiting\n- Allegiance: Maelthor\n- Goals: Recruitment, “cleansing” the world, human supremacy\n- Activity: Active protest presence and covert indoctrination\n- Presentation: Publicly defensive; privately extremist cult doctrine", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 732, "post_filter_count": 30, "duration_ms": 28, "top_5": [["ent_shepherds_flock", 2.4918], ["ent_maelthor", 1.8], ["ent_non_human_threats", 1.2414], ["ent_tidal_turtles", 1.0304], ["ent_secure_shipment_shepherds", 0.9747]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_shepherds_flock", "ent_maelthor", "ent_non_human_threats", "ent_tidal_turtles", "ent_secure_shipment_shepherds", "ent_the_region", "ent_agility_potion", "ent_players", "ent_towns_and_villages", "ent_arcane_instruments_and_charms", "ent_aspitome", "ent_demons", "ent_devils", "ent_healing_potions", "ent_hidden_alchemy_room", "ent_historical_atrocities_and_justifications", "ent_human_sympathizers", "ent_impact_on_local_populations", "ent_inns", "ent_local_markets", "ent_mystery_potions", "ent_nearby_region", "ent_night_scenes", "ent_non_human_villages", "ent_ointment", "ent_ordinary_game", "ent_other_place", "ent_pack", "ent_ponds", "ent_racist_human_cult"], "semantic_rerank": {"enabled": false}, "evidence_first": {"enabled": true, "duration_ms": 15, "top_k": 24, "neighbor_window": 1, "max_neighbors": 24, "selected_count": 75, "seeded_count": 24, "selected_evidence_ids": ["evid_18de21406ddc5ef9", "evid_b69bb6e923bd1937", "evid_b79583f3fd545e35", "evid_b79583f3fd545e35", "evid_b79583f3fd545e35", "evid_b79583f3fd545e35", "evid_efc8d28d1c119dec", "evid_65cb1223d057140a", "evid_b79583f3fd545e35", "evid_b79583f3fd545e35", "evid_d4ee3917adf4082f", "evid_769b565ecf0611d9", "evid_f77beee73251df5d", "evid_bd33cf8ccacd4868", "evid_ed4c1845ab014824", "evid_c3ba7267b3e0d97e", "evid_e0b3b3f890cf03d8", "evid_bfb9f6e1dfc53dc3", "evid_337b0d067716f91e", "evid_eea404e47420d0c0", "evid_760d6947ab4dec1a", "evid_8043e650751a7203", "evid_f874a8e185304074", "evid_945952f5ee222f55", "evid_bfb9f6e1dfc53dc3", "evid_337b0d067716f91e", "evid_eea404e47420d0c0", "evid_760d6947ab4dec1a", "evid_8043e650751a7203", "evid_f874a8e185304074", "evid_945952f5ee222f55", "evid_bfb9f6e1dfc53dc3", "evid_337b0d067716f91e", "evid_eea404e47420d0c0", "evid_760d6947ab4dec1a", "evid_8043e650751a7203", "evid_f874a8e185304074", "evid_945952f5ee222f55", "evid_bfb9f6e1dfc53dc3", "evid_337b0d067716f91e", "evid_eea404e47420d0c0", "evid_760d6947ab4dec1a", "evid_8043e650751a7203", "evid_f874a8e185304074", "evid_945952f5ee222f55", "evid_4dd621d457de05c4", "evid_23b8efb77d91c50a", "evid_bfb9f6e1dfc53dc3", "evid_337b0d067716f91e", "evid_eea404e47420d0c0", "evid_760d6947ab4dec1a", "evid_8043e650751a7203", "evid_f874a8e185304074"