{"id": "q_the_city_council_2", "question": "Who speaks for the wizards on the council, and what's his angle on the cult?", "answer": "TL;DR: Headmaster Tinkerbright represents the wizards on the council, and he views the cult as a dangerous magical perversion that must be aggressively detected and contained using arcane means.\n\nHeadmaster Tinkerbright (OBSERVED/CANON) is the Head of the Wizard’s College and serves as the arcane representative on the council. \n\nHis angle on the cult is strongly interventionist and magic-focused:\n- He views the corrupted meat as a perversion of magic (CANON).\n- He takes the threat extremely seriously and is deeply troubled by the dark magic involved (CANON).\n- He is eager to deploy the Wizard’s College’s resources to detect and counteract the cult’s influence (OBSERVED).\n- His plan includes using runes and detection spells to locate corruption and potentially a magical lockdown of the city (OBSERVED).\n\nOverall, Tinkerbright’s stance is that the cult is fundamentally a magical threat requiring a coordinated arcane response, with an emphasis on detection, containment, and citywide magical control.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Role: Head of the Wizard’s College; arcane council representative (OBSERVED)\n- Faction: Wizard’s College (CANON)\n- Goals: Magical detection of corruption; proposed arcane lockdown; counteract cult influence (OBSERVED)\n- Attitude toward cult: Sees it as a perversion of magic; urgent, proactive response (CANON)", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 732, "post_filter_count": 30, "duration_ms": 26, "top_5": [["ent_the_cult", 2.5599], ["ent_city_council", 2.4199], ["ent_wizards_college", 2.22], ["ent_grobnok_the_goblin", 2.0685], ["ent_barin", 1.8885]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_the_cult", "ent_city_council", "ent_wizards_college", "ent_grobnok_the_goblin", "ent_barin", "ent_ancient_wards", "ent_guard", "ent_magical_runes", "ent_wizards_meat_detection_spell", "ent_wizards_college_detection_spell", "ent_wizards_tower_basement", "ent_commander_elric_vane", "ent_torbin", "ent_political_intrigue_among_the_council", "ent_clues", "ent_mayor_elara_swiftwind", "ent_charismatic_cult_leaders", "ent_headmaster_tinkerbright", "ent_torrin_flamescale", "ent_agricultural_district", "ent_merril", "ent_the_shepherd", "ent_representative_of_the_guilds", "ent_the_city", "ent_armed_groups", "ent_cult_controlled_areas", "ent_cult_suspect_locations", "ent_different_factions_within_the_city", "ent_escape_route", "ent_escape_tunnel"], "semantic_rerank": {"enabled": false}, "evidence_first": {"enabled": true, "duration_ms": 10, "top_k": 24, "neighbor_window": 1, "max_neighbors": 24, "selected_count": 80, "seeded_count": 48, "selected_evidence_ids": ["evid_209b2689e7059a51", "evid_095acd58ffe842a8", "evid_b810741feddfd044", "evid_3d7ad4320dbdc4c0", "evid_98043b5605a6cc46", "evid_31c62c76e535645a", "evid_5e9f1a4931c92cc4", "evid_f16de03d237c5250", "evid_72907d1839a873d0", "evid_508e7be9d3fcdd98", "evid_e7d7e2596accecc8", "evid_8554a62e4404cde5", "evid_b69bb6e923bd1937", "evid_a28981a2465bd328", "evid_f00ae49ac384880c", "evid_24ac0583adb992f4", "evid_71b1c1affbad3501", "evid_24ac0583adb992f4", "evid_71b1c1affbad3501", "evid_5be6bba1738369e3", "evid_bb86689bedd3a9e5", "evid_e6b88f37f463ca20", "evid_50d115918f9f1095", "evid_d18a7c2abbcb5d20", "evid_57fec2777c8d97fd", "evid_23b8efb77d91c50a", "evid_001e94e6f3124fd3", "evid_e4066f3f8b836546", "evid_5be6bba1738369e3", "evid_bb86689bedd3a9e5", "evid_e6b88f37f463ca20", "evid_5b5dd8b81c947c13", "evid_8a1307d504a7de89", "evid_1f59bb96ea83d0af", "evid_9fb22fe4af1b0a8f", "evid_a68b38b83ba8d0bc", "evid_75f7c046050b0955", "evid_3e1000f002ada69a", "evid_889c40d9eecbc4b0", "evid_2b6210fa67e69fac", "evid_5a9b5a94a53d2149", "evid_6470c73744726f16", "evid_7c9e47820a7c60f8", "evid_6bb94b9bfc552806", "evid_484dcef0630389e3", "evid_a1ecde71c06861c9", "evid_19a33ec3f9f016b8", "evid_4cdbbf99275984ba", "evid_dce0e6bd2e40d75c"