{"id": "q_the_city_council_4", "question": "Merril, Torrin, Rurik-what's each one's job on the council?", "answer": "TL;DR: Torrin is the Guilds’ representative (Master Smith); Merril and Rurik’s specific council roles are not stated in the provided context.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Torrin Flamescale (CANON/OBSERVED): Master Smith; Representative of the Guilds; serves as the voice of the craft guilds on the council.\n- Merril: No role or title provided in the projection.\n- Rurik Stonehammer: Identified only indirectly via “his city,” but no explicit council job or title is given.\n\nThere’s clear, consistent evidence for Torrin Flamescale as the Guilds’ representative on the council. However, the projection does not include any facts defining Merril’s or Rurik Stonehammer’s official council positions.", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 732, "post_filter_count": 30, "duration_ms": 35, "top_5": [["ent_torrin_flamescale", 2.0232], ["ent_merril", 1.9502], ["ent_merril_tealeaf", 1.7902], ["ent_torrin", 1.7032], ["ent_representative_of_the_guilds", 1.6632]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_torrin_flamescale", "ent_merril", "ent_merril_tealeaf", "ent_torrin", "ent_representative_of_the_guilds", "ent_city_defenses", "ent_rurik_stonehammer", "ent_rurik", "ent_stonebridge", "ent_glowkindle", "ent_city_council", "ent_agricultural_union", "ent_spells", "ent_potions", "ent_headmaster_tinkerbright", "ent_the_cult", "ent_players", "ent_the_city", "ent_agricultural_district", "ent_dwarf", "ent_armed_groups", "ent_broken_alchemical_tools", "ent_citizenry", "ent_crest_of_the_city_guard", "ent_dark_blue_tunic", "ent_earth_toned_dress", "ent_every_district", "ent_flaming_magma_infused_spider_monstrosity", "ent_forgotten_chambers", "ent_front_door"], "semantic_rerank": {"enabled": false}, "evidence_first": {"enabled": true, "duration_ms": 11, "top_k": 24, "neighbor_window": 1, "max_neighbors": 24, "selected_count": 55, "seeded_count": 32, "s